ct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. May to June came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 76% of normal in July to August and 69% in August to September. Grid 27815 had its driest year in 1964, at 71% of normal.</p>"}
